# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working files — deliberately not published
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PLAN.md and PROGRESS.md track how the work is being carried out. They are not
# deliverables. The design doc and every file under docs/ ARE deliverables and
# are committed.
PLAN.md
PROGRESS.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything under backend/data/ is reproducible from a seed via
# `guardmatch generate-data`, so committing it would add weight without adding
# information. Model artifacts under backend/models/ are NOT ignored — versioned
# artifacts are a project deliverable.
#
# The leading slash anchors this to the repository root. Without it, the pattern
# would also match backend/src/guardmatch/data/ — the synthetic data generator
# package — and silently exclude source code from every commit. That is not
# hypothetical: it happened once and was fixed in commit efff6ce.
/backend/data/
*.parquet
*.feather

